Targets:

Title: Collie Kart P007b.2

Summary: Endpoint-aware stopping, route-progress scoring and six-attempt recorder

Description: |
    Experimental supervised Mario Kart 7 USA Rev2 imitation driver.
    Loads saved demonstration CSV, trains a small steering regression
    entirely on New Nintendo 3DS, and drives toward waypoint reference
    under hard native-command deadline with manual physical override.
    Six attempts stored in RAM, with individual CSV decision/action/error
    exports and best-performing steering-gain search. Only offline
    Toad Circuit Time Trial. Untested on hardware; P006.4 fallback preserved.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
